\newlabel{tab:h0}{{2}{6}{Independent measurements of $H_0$ compared to the SST prediction. The GFD band (65.9--74.6~km\,s$^{-1}$\,Mpc$^{-1}$) is the $\pm 6.2\%$ geometric aperture uncertainty. All six measurements fall within the band}{table.2}{}}
